      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but i think it needs to be a bit more meaty. the board is really looking for something that feels \"big scale\" and has a lot of depth to it.\n\nthe first draft was a bit brief. could you expand on this? maybe go into more detail about how the community structures change and how the project grows over time. \n\njust a reminder though—don't go overboard with those buzzwords. i checked the score on that first draft and it was okay, but i don't want a version that is just a list of \"sustainable\" and \"transformative\" over and over. it's gotta feel real. can you give me a longer, more detailed version?",
